    "body": "- \"Introduce concept of a \"potentially nullable\" type\" solves the first of those three points by also making things a bit nicer.\r\n- \"Clairfy that the inner types are \"directly within\" ...\" I think solves the second point, but I'm not 100% sure it does not have unintended side effects by making things stricter.\r\n- For the third point, there is already https://github.com/whatwg/webidl/issues/827. How it interacts with potentially nullable types really depends on what solution we'll have for that issue.",
